  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place tortillas on a cutting board. Spread peanut butter evenly over each tortilla, then drizzle with honey."
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel bananas and place at one end of each tortilla. Roll each tortilla up around the banana, then slice crosswise into 1-inch rounds."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide roll-ups between plates. Enjoy!"
